{"updated":"2026-11-10T03:41:05.821Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: One Nation dumps Victorian election candidate who praised Adolf Hitler as ‘GOAT’. Elsewhere, california voters reject proposed one-time tax on billionaires' wealth. And saudi Arabia downs missiles fired at Riyadh after Houthi attack on pipeline. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on Ukraine, at active conflict levels, though US, and Iran are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 3.4 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial up 1.4 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 7.7 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 45 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.7 near 106 km ENE of Hasaki, Japan. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.17,0.22,0.26,0.3,0.35,0.4,0.43,0.48,0.52,0.56,0.58,0.61,0.64,0.69,0.8,0.89,1.04,1.32,1.44,1.5,1.53,1.56,1.6,1.63,1.65,1.67,1.72,1.76,1.83,1.9,1.95,1.99,2.02,2.07,2.1,2.14,2.19,2.24,2.29,2.32,2.37,2.42,2.46,2.52,2.57,2.62,2.69,2.76,2.88,2.97,3.09,3.12,3.17,3.19,3.25,3.3,3.35,3.47,3.56,3.62,3.7,3.75,3.81,3.85,3.9,3.95,3.97,3.99,4.04,4.06,4.09,4.11,4.16,4.2,4.28,4.34,4.41,4.49,4.55,4.67,4.7,4.77,4.79,4.87,4.98,5.13,5.31,5.91,6.03,6.09,6.13,6.19,6.24,6.35,6.41,6.46,6.5,6.56,6.64,6.7,6.77,6.82,6.87,6.94,7.01,7.05,7.11,7.17,7.23,7.35,7.42,7.48,7.52,7.55,7.61,7.65,7.72,7.79,7.85,7.89,7.93,7.98,8.01,8.08,8.13,8.21,8.24,8.3,8.36,8.42,8.47,8.52,8.64,8.71,8.77,8.82,8.87,8.94,8.99,9.07,9.13,9.18,9.23,9.29,9.31,9.39,9.51,9.58,9.64,9.68,9.73,9.79,9.82,9.9,9.97,10.04,10.11,10.17,10.32,10.45,10.49,10.55,10.59,10.66,10.77,10.87,10.89,11.06,11.18,11.56,11.68,11.74,11.8,11.85,11.9,11.96,12.01,12.06,12.18,12.22,12.35,12.42,12.5,12.56,12.62,12.68,12.72,12.77,12.82,12.86,12.91,12.97,13.03,13.12,13.19,13.25,13.28,13.33,13.41,13.46,13.54,13.62,13.